{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"read\":\"main\",\"long\":\"莫名压力推着我想理清心结，却连从哪开始都不知道。\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"read\":\"main\",\"long\":\"这不是头一回：平静时旧日难过又回来，搅乱安稳，让我烦躁。\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"read\":\"main\",\"long\":\"过去的好、眼下的难受和对安宁的盼望一齐涌来，生活兴致短暂回来，却仍不稳。\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"read\":\"main\",\"long\":\"我不再硬压想念，允许舍不得多留一会儿，把它当作曾珍惜过的痕迹。\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"read\":\"all\",\"long\":\"\",\"follow\":\"能\",\"why\":\"能\"}\n  ],\n  \"overall\":\"S06最赶，只能读完主句并扫到少数词；S08、S09、S12主句能读完，但次组来不及逐条看完。S13、S14虽然停留较久，情绪转折和并列意象仍然偏密，尤其S13安宁骤然破裂、S14多种情绪同时涌来，容易只抓到强烈感受，却难以一次理清每层意思。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "38c9e684-412d-46bd-8550-58cd6b59d471", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T140210469794Z", "elapsed_seconds": 133.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T14:04:23.759831+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_